translate italian mcgee18_d2594747:

    # "Afterwards, we lie in bed for a moment, catching our breath."
    "In seguito, restiamo sdraiati a letto per un momento, riprendendo fiato."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:18
translate italian mcgee18_f4e1b073:

    # mrmg "So, [pcname]..."
    mrmg "Allora, [pcname]..."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:19
translate italian mcgee18_f6b60d54:

    # mrmg "Edie was saying that you're about to graduate. Any plans for after you finish school?"
    mrmg "Edie diceva che stai per diplomarti. Hai qualche progetto per quando finirai la scuola?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:20
translate italian mcgee18_158b58fb:

    # pc "Oh um... I'm not sure."
    pc "Oh, ehm... non ne sono sicuro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:23
translate italian mcgee18_338c53f3:

    # et "You're a smart boy. I hope you have some idea of what you're going to do."
    et "Sei un ragazzo intelligente. Spero che tu abbia un'idea di cosa farai."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:24
translate italian mcgee18_a8107df4:

    # mrmg "Yeah, it's good to have a plan. Even if you don't end up sticking to it."
    mrmg "Sì, è bene avere un piano. Anche se poi non lo segui fino in fondo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:25
translate italian mcgee18_67ffd2ed:

    # mrmg "When I was your age, I never would have imagined I'd be running a coffee shop in a small town."
    mrmg "Quando avevo la tua età, non avrei mai immaginato che avrei gestito una caffetteria in una piccola città."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:26
translate italian mcgee18_6ed16a5b:

    # et "He wanted to be an architect."
    et "Lui voleva fare l’architetto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:27
translate italian mcgee18_1f4c7425:

    # mrmg "I couldn't ever wrap my head around the math."
    mrmg "Non sono mai riuscito a capire la matematica."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:30
translate italian mcgee18_7dc88a4e:

    # pc "I haven't decided exactly, but I may work in a lab somewhere, like my dad did. Or maybe travel?"
    pc "Non ho ancora deciso con esattezza, ma potrei lavorare in un laboratorio da qualche parte, come faceva mio padre. O magari viaggiare?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:31
translate italian mcgee18_a852eda0:

    # mrmg "Well you still have time. As long as you're moving forward, you know?"
    mrmg "Beh, hai ancora tempo. L’importante è andare avanti, no?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:32
translate italian mcgee18_81828f00:

    # et "What about romance?"
    et "E l’amore?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:33
translate italian mcgee18_f31c9253:

    # mrmg "Yes, any chance of you settling down soon?"
    mrmg "Sì, c’è qualche possibilità che tu metta la testa a posto presto?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:38
translate italian mcgee18_0da9fddf:

    # pc "I have somebody in mind who I might want to settle down with, yeah."
    pc "Ho in mente una persona con cui potrei voler mettere la testa a posto, sì."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:39
translate italian mcgee18_91054e3c:

    # et "That's great."
    et "È fantastico."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:40
translate italian mcgee18_039a1f3c:

    # mrmg "Yeah, we're happy for you!"
    mrmg "Sì, siamo felici per te!"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:42
translate italian mcgee18_3a5905ee:

    # pc "I haven't met anybody yet that I'd want to settle down with."
    pc "Non ho ancora incontrato nessuno con cui vorrei sistemarmi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:43
translate italian mcgee18_560976b8:

    # et "I'm sure you will. A young girl would be very lucky to be with you."
    et "Sono sicura che lo troverai. Una ragazza sarebbe molto fortunata a stare con te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:44
translate italian mcgee18_5a3cddaa:

    # mrmg "For sure. You'll get your pick of the litter and eventually find someone who checks all the boxes you're looking for."
    mrmg "Di sicuro. Potrai scegliere tra le migliori e alla fine troverai qualcuno che soddisfi tutti i requisiti che cerchi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:46
translate italian mcgee18_313c0671:

    # pc "Why settle, when I can mess around with a bunch of different people?"
    pc "Perché sistemarmi, quando posso divertirmi con un sacco di persone diverse?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:47
translate italian mcgee18_a1c5c517:

    # mrmg "Haha, it's true, that's fun... for a while."
    mrmg "Haha, è vero, è divertente... per un po’."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:48
translate italian mcgee18_1e788beb:

    # et "I think that, eventually, you're going to want more though."
    et "Penso però che, alla fine, vorrai qualcosa di più."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:51
translate italian mcgee18_650ed17b:

    # mrmg "Edie and I were just talking about you the other night. About how we hope that you'll find a nice girl to marry."
    mrmg "Io ed Edie stavamo proprio parlando di te l’altra sera. Di come speriamo che tu trovi una brava ragazza da sposare."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:52
translate italian mcgee18_39aeeae4:

    # et "Like we found each other."
    et "Come ci siamo trovati noi."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:53
translate italian mcgee18_1c927abb:

    # mrmg "There's nothing quite like being in love with your best friend."
    mrmg "Non c’è niente di meglio che essere innamorati del proprio migliore amico."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:56
translate italian mcgee18_f53975a4:

    # pc "It does seem nice."
    pc "Sembra davvero bello."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:59
translate italian mcgee18_35c5f2a1:

    # "We get dressed and say our goodbyes."
    "Ci vestiamo e ci salutiamo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:60
translate italian mcgee18_aea74b6e:

    # "Their relationship is a little strange, but damn they do love each other."
    "La loro relazione è un po’ strana, ma cavolo, si amano davvero."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee18.rpy:61
translate italian mcgee18_70b92f51:

    # "It must be nice to feel that close to another person. Maybe I will have something like that one day."
    "Deve essere bello sentirsi così vicini a un’altra persona. Forse un giorno avrò qualcosa del genere."

